# Ask before commit and push

When this session has changed files, ask Khauram whether to commit and whether to push. Wait for a yes before either step.

- A yes to commit is not a yes to push. Confirm each one.
- Ask at the end of the change, including model, docs, and rule edits.
- Leave the work uncommitted until he answers.
- Follow `.cursor/rules/commit-messages.mdc` for the message.
